    <!-- Bowling screen strings. Prefixed bw_. -->
    <string name="bw_help_title">How to play Bowling</string>
    <string name="bw_help_text">Set where the ball starts, its aim, spin and speed with the sliders, then press Roll. Or use touch: drag across the foot of the lane to place the ball, then swipe up. The angle of the swipe is the aim, its speed is the pace and a curve in the swipe puts hook on the ball. Ten frames: a strike scores 10 plus the next two balls, a spare 10 plus the next ball, and the tenth frame gives a third ball after a strike or a spare. The rack in the corner shows which pins are left.</string>
